https://satoshinotebook.com/properties-of-money,p,money must maintain its properties across time:
https://satoshinotebook.com/properties-of-money,p,money must be separable into smaller units:
https://satoshinotebook.com/properties-of-money,p,money must be easily transported:
https://satoshinotebook.com/properties-of-money,p,money must maintain limited supply:
https://satoshinotebook.com/properties-of-money,p,money must be mutually interchangeable:
https://satoshinotebook.com/properties-of-money,p,money must be easily authenticated:
https://satoshinotebook.com/properties-of-money,p,money must be widely recognized and accepted:
https://satoshinotebook.com/properties-of-money,p,these properties cannot exist in isolation - they must work together in perfect harmony. the failure of any single property compromises the entire system.
https://satoshinotebook.com/properties-of-money,p,"true money achieves the ideal balance of all these properties simultaneously, creating a reliable system for storing and transferring value across time and space. each property reinforces the others, creating a robust and effective monetary system."
