https://satoshinotebook.com/inflation-is-a-problem,h3,The Economic Bloodletting
https://satoshinotebook.com/inflation-is-a-problem,h3,The Oxygen Metaphor
https://satoshinotebook.com/inflation-is-a-problem,h3,The Hidden Tax
