https://satoshinotebook.com/bitcoin-is-the-first-engineered-money,p,"bitcoin is the world's first engineered monetary network - a breakthrough innovation combining cryptography, distributed systems, and game theory to create incorruptible digital scarcity and enable trustless value transfer."
https://satoshinotebook.com/bitcoin-is-the-first-engineered-money,p,"at its core, bitcoin solves the double-spending problem that had prevented digital scarcity for decades. through an elegant combination of cryptographic proof and economic incentives, it creates the first digital asset that cannot be copied or counterfeited:"
https://satoshinotebook.com/bitcoin-is-the-first-engineered-money,p,bitcoin's system consists of several key innovations working in harmony:
