https://satoshinotebook.com/the-discovery,p,Bitcoin represents one of the most profound technological breakthroughs in human history: the discovery of how to create absolute scarcity in the digital realm through trustless consensus.
https://satoshinotebook.com/the-discovery,p,"For decades, computer scientists believed it was impossible to create digital scarcity without a central authority. This was known as the Byzantine Generals Problem: how do you achieve consensus among distributed parties who don't trust each other, when some might be malicious?"
https://satoshinotebook.com/the-discovery,p,"Satoshi's breakthrough was realizing that you could combine several existing technologies in a novel way to create a self-sustaining, trustless system:"
https://satoshinotebook.com/the-discovery,p,"What makes Bitcoin truly revolutionary is how these fault-prone computers, scattered across the globe, come together to create something more reliable than any centralized system:"
https://satoshinotebook.com/the-discovery,p,From this elegant coordination emerge properties that were previously thought impossible in digital systems:
https://satoshinotebook.com/the-discovery,p,"Bitcoin achieves something unprecedented: it creates objective truth in the digital realm without requiring trust in any party. The network reaches consensus not through authority or voting, but through pure mathematics and economic incentives."
