https://satoshinotebook.com/bitcoin-simplifies-reality,p,bitcoin eliminates the burden of financial complexity from human civilization - freeing minds from tracking thousands of moving parts and returning humanity to the focused pursuit of excellence in their true calling.
https://satoshinotebook.com/bitcoin-simplifies-reality,p,"in a fiat world, every mind must juggle thousands of variables - tracking indices, following markets, evaluating stocks, monitoring trends. this cognitive burden steals focus from what truly matters, forcing everyone to become part-time financial analysts just to preserve their wealth."
https://satoshinotebook.com/bitcoin-simplifies-reality,p,"when monetary complexity consumes mental bandwidth, it directly inhibits excellence in one's true vocation. bitcoin liberates this cognitive capacity:"
